From 2f5aea232d9d875c09b7c35347257802fb45b39c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:46:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Documentation: review of the pages and comments changed by
 the prototype

The pages of docs/web, the installation guides and the comments of the
headers and sources added or changed by the prototype were checked against
the code (160 findings, 155 fixed here, the other ones being code issues
left for later):

- generic-parallel.md: no layout of TFEL groups the points by element;
  synchronous rotations given RotationMatrix2D or RotationMatrix3D are
  refused for a library whose memory space is device; an error of the
  device after the submission of an asynchronous computation is reported
  neither by an exception nor by the status; null memory resource with a
  shared location; make_unchecked_view, updateInputValues,
  setProfilingSynchronization and the variants with field operations;
- install.md and INSTALL-cmake.md: enable-parallel-stl-algorithms is off by
  default; requirements of enable-generic-parallel-cuda-tests (help text of
  the option updated, no change of behaviour);
- FieldView::hasDistinctValues, status -2 of the batch material
  properties, types of the profiling data, layout of MaterialStateManager,
  update and revert with field operations;
- links of the main Doxygen page, list of the branches, typos.

No code is changed: the sources without their comments are identical.
